htrij van de server."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodano do kolejki zadań serwera."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajouté à la file de tâches du serveur."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Añadido a la cola de tareas del servidor."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adicionado à fila de tarefas do servidor."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Добавлено в очередь задач сервера."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zur Job-Warteschlange des Servers hinzugefügt."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aggiunto alla coda di attività del server."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Added to the server's job queue."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lagt til i serverens jobbkø."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sunucunun iş kuyruğuna eklendi."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已加入伺服器的工作佇列。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tillagt i serverns jobbkö."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已添加到服务器的任务队列。"}}}},"hint_add_scenes_with_plus_on":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lägg till scener med + på en scen som spelas eller med bevakningslisteknappen på en scensida. De spelas här efter varandra."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oynatılan bir sahnede + ile veya sahne sayfasındaki izleme listesi düğmesiyle sahne ekle. Burada art arda oynatılırlar."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在正在播放的短片上点按 +，或在短片页面点按稍后观看按钮来添加短片。它们会在这里依次播放。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在播放中的短片上點 +，或在短片頁面上點待看清單按鈕即可加入短片。它們會在這裡依序播放。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生中のシーンの＋、またはシーンページのウォッチリストボタンでシーンを追加できます。ここで順番に再生されます。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voeg scènes toe met + bij een spelende scène of met de kijklijstknop op een scènepagina. Ze worden hier na elkaar afgespeeld."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajoutez des scènes avec + sur une scène en cours de lecture ou avec le bouton de liste à regarder sur la page d'une scène. Elles sont lues ici l'une après l'autre."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Añade escenas con + en una escena en reproducción o con el botón de lista para ver en la página de una escena. Aquí se reproducen una tras otra."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legg til scener med + på en scene som spilles, eller med Se senere-knappen på en sceneside. De spilles her etter hverandre."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"재생 중인 영상의 +나 영상 페이지의 시청 목록 버튼으로 영상을 추가하세요. 추가한 영상이 여기에서 차례로 재생됩니다."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tilføj scener med + på en scene, der afspilles, eller med Se senere-knappen på en sceneside. De afspilles her efter hinanden."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aggiungi scene con + su una scena in riproduzione o con il pulsante Da guardare nella pagina di una scena. Qui vengono riprodotte una dopo l'altra."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodawaj sceny przyciskiem + na odtwarzanej scenie lub przyciskiem Do obejrzenia na stronie sceny. Będą tu odtwarzane jedna po drugiej."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Добавляйте сцены кнопкой + в воспроизводимой сцене или кнопкой «Смотреть позже» на странице сцены. Здесь они воспроизводятся одна за другой."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Add scenes with + on a playing scene or the watchlist button on a scene page. They play here one after another."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Füge Szenen mit + bei einer laufenden Szene oder mit der Merkliste-Taste auf einer Szenenseite hinzu. Sie werden hier nacheinander abgespielt."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adicione cenas com + em uma cena em reprodução ou com o botão da lista para assistir na página da cena. Elas são reproduzidas aqui uma após a outra."}}}},"hint_adds_magazin_view_on_home":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tilføjer en Magazin-visning på Hjem, der viser dine gallerier som covers. De åbnes som et magasin og husker den side, du stoppede på."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aggiunge alla Home una vista Magazin che mostra le tue gallerie come copertine. Si aprono come una rivista e ricordano la pagina a cui eri arrivato."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voegt een Magazin-weergave toe op Home die je galerijen als omslagen toont. Ze openen als een tijdschrift en onthouden de pagina waar je bent gebleven."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fügt auf Start eine Magazin-Ansicht hinzu, die deine Galerien als Cover zeigt. Sie öffnen sich wie ein Magazin und merken sich die Seite, auf der du aufgehört hast."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lägger till en Magazin-vy på Hem som visar dina gallerier som omslag. De öppnas som en tidning och kommer ihåg sidan där du slutade."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Добавляет на главную вид Magazin, где галереи показаны обложками. Они открываются как журнал и запоминают страницу, на которой вы остановились."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajoute à l'accueil une vue Magazin qui affiche vos galeries sous forme de couvertures. Elles s'ouvrent comme un magazine et se souviennent de la page où vous vous êtes arrêté."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adds a Magazin view on Home that shows your galleries as covers. They open like a magazine and remember the page you stopped on."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"갤러리를 표지로 보여주는 Magazin 보기를 홈에 추가합니다. 잡지처럼 열리고 마지막으로 읽은 페이지를 기억합니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodaje na ekranie Start widok Magazin, który pokazuje galerie jako okładki. Otwierają się jak czasopismo i pamiętają stronę, na której skończyłeś."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legger til en Magazin-visning på Hjem som viser galleriene dine som omslag. De åpnes som et blad og husker siden du stoppet på."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Añade a Inicio una vista Magazin que muestra tus galerías como portadas. Se abren como una revista y recuerdan la página en la que te quedaste."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ギャラリーを表紙として表示するMagazinビューをホームに追加します。雑誌のように開き、読み終えたページを記憶します。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adiciona ao Início uma visualização Magazin que mostra suas galerias como capas. Elas abrem como uma revista e lembram a página onde você parou."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在首頁加入 Magazin 檢視，以封面顯示你的圖庫。它們會像雜誌一樣打開，並記住你上次停下的頁面。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在主页添加 Magazin 视图，以封面形式显示你的图库。它们像杂志一样打开，并会记住你停留的页面。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'ya galerilerini kapak olarak gösteren bir Magazin görünümü ekler. Galeriler dergi gibi açılır ve kaldığın sayfayı hatırlar."}}}},"hint_add_stash_servers_and_switch":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash sunucuları ekle ve aralarında geçiş yap. Bir sunucuyu düzenlemek veya kayıtlı bir sunucuyu kaldırmak için üzerinde Seç'i basılı tut."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lägg till Stash-servrar och växla mellan dem. Håll ned Välj på en server för att redigera den eller ta bort en sparad server."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"添加 Stash 服务器并在它们之间切换。在服务器上按住选择键可编辑或移除已存的服务器。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"新增 Stash 伺服器並在它們之間切換。在伺服器上按住「選擇」即可編輯或移除已儲存的伺服器。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Füge Stash-Server hinzu und wechsle zwischen ihnen. Halte Auswählen auf einem Server gedrückt, um ihn zu bearbeiten oder einen gespeicherten zu entfernen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajoutez des serveurs Stash et passez de l'un à l'autre. Maintenez Sélectionner sur un serveur pour le modifier ou supprimer un serveur enregistré."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodawaj serwery Stash i przełączaj się między nimi. Przytrzymaj Wybierz na serwerze, aby go edytować lub usunąć zapisany."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adicione servidores Stash e alterne entre eles. Mantenha Selecionar pressionado em um servidor para editá-lo ou remover um salvo."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voeg Stash-servers toe en schakel ertussen. Houd Select ingedrukt op een server om hem te wijzigen of een bewaarde te verwijderen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legg til Stash-servere og bytt mellom dem. Hold inne Velg på en server for å redigere den eller fjerne en lagret server."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aggiungi server Stash e passa dall'uno all'altro. Tieni premuto Seleziona su un server per modificarlo o rimuoverne uno salvato."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Добавляйте серверы Stash и переключайтесь между ними. Удерживайте «Выбор» на сервере, чтобы изменить или удалить его."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Add Stash servers and switch between them. Hold Select on a server to edit it or remove a saved one."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 서버를 추가하고 서버 간에 전환합니다. 서버를 편집하거나 저장된 서버를 제거하려면 해당 서버에서 선택 버튼을 길게 누르세요."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tilføj Stash-servere, og skift mellem dem. Hold Vælg nede på en server for at redigere den eller fjerne en gemt server."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Añade servidores Stash y cambia entre ellos. Mantén pulsado Seleccionar sobre un servidor para editarlo o eliminar uno guardado."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashサーバーを追加して切り替えます。サーバー上で選択ボタンを長押しすると、編集や保存済みサーバーの削除ができます。"}}}},"hint_add_stash_servers_switch_between":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajoutez des serveurs Stash, passez de l'un à l'autre, et modifiez ou supprimez ceux enregistrés."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aggiungi server Stash, passa dall'uno all'altro e modifica o rimuovi quelli salvati."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Füge Stash-Server hinzu, wechsle zwischen ihnen und bearbeite oder entferne gespeicherte."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voeg Stash-servers toe, schakel ertussen en wijzig of verwijder bewaarde servers."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodawaj serwery Stash, przełączaj się między nimi oraz edytuj lub usuwaj zapisane."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tilføj Stash-servere, skift mellem dem, og rediger eller fjern gemte servere."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legg til Stash-servere, bytt mellom dem, og rediger eller fjern lagrede servere."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adicione servidores Stash, alterne entre eles e edite ou remova os salvos."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Add Stash servers, switch between them, and edit or remove saved ones."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Añade servidores Stash, cambia entre ellos y edita o elimina los guardados."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 서버를 추가하고 서버 간에 전환하며 저장된 서버를 편집하거나 제거합니다."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Добавляйте серверы Stash, переключайтесь между ними, изменяйте или удаляйте сохраненные."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashサーバーを追加して切り替えたり、保存済みのサーバーを編集・削除したりできます。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"添加 Stash 服务器、在它们之间切换，并编辑或移除已存的服务器。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash sunucuları ekle, aralarında geçiş yap, kayıtlı olanları düzenle veya kaldır."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lägg till Stash-servrar, växla mellan dem och redigera eller ta bort sparade servrar."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"新增 Stash 伺服器、在它們之間切換，以及編輯或移除已儲存的伺服器。"}}}},"hint_ai_captions_are_part_of":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertexter ingår i stashy+"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI altyazılar stashy+'nın parçasıdır"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕属于 stashy+"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕是 stashy+ 的一部分"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-bijschriften maken deel uit van stashy+"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI字幕はstashy+の機能です"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Los subtítulos con IA forman parte de stashy+"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-teksting er en del av stashy+"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ИИ-субтитры входят в stashy+"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"KI-Untertitel sind Teil von stashy+"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI captions are part of stashy+"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del af stashy+"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 캡션은 stashy+의 일부입니다"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendas por IA fazem parte do stashy+"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Napisy AI są częścią stashy+"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sous-titres IA font partie de stashy+"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"I sottotitoli IA fanno parte di stashy+"}}}},"hint_ai_captions_are_part_of_stashy":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Napisy AI są częścią stashy+ — odblokuj w Ustawieniach"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Los subtítulos con IA forman parte de stashy+; desbloquéalo en Ajustes"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI captions are part of stashy+ — unlock in Settings"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendas por IA fazem parte do stashy+ — desbloqueie em Ajustes"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sous-titres IA font partie de stashy+ — débloquez-les dans les réglages"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI字幕はstashy+の機能です。設定でロックを解除してください"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"KI-Untertitel sind Teil von stashy+ – in den Einstellungen freischalten"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del af stashy+ – lås op i Indstillinger"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 캡션은 stashy+의 일부입니다 — 설정에서 잠금 해제하세요"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ИИ-субтитры входят в stashy+ — разблокируйте в настройках"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"I sottotitoli IA fanno parte di stashy+: sbloccali in Impostazioni"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-bijschriften maken deel uit van stashy+ – ontgrendel in Instellingen"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-teksting er en del av stashy+ – lås opp i Innstillinger"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕是 stashy+ 的一部分 — 請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI altyazılar stashy+'nın parçasıdır — Ayarlar'da kilidini aç"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕属于 stashy+ — 请在设置中解锁"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertexter ingår i stashy+ – lås upp i Inställningar"}}}},"hint_ai_motion_is_part_of":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion stashy+'nın parçasıdır — Ayarlar'da kilidini aç"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion 是 stashy+ 的一部分 — 請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion 属于 stashy+ — 请在设置中解锁"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion ingår i stashy+ – lås upp i Inställningar"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion jest częścią stashy+ — odblokuj w Ustawieniach"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion er en del af stashy+ – lås op i Indstillinger"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion ist Teil von stashy+ – in den Einstellungen freischalten"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion은 stashy+의 일부입니다 — 설정에서 잠금 해제하세요"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion forma parte de stashy+; desbloquéalo en Ajustes"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion fait partie de stashy+ — débloquez-le dans les réglages"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion maakt deel uit van stashy+ – ontgrendel in Instellingen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion is part of stashy+ — unlock in Settings"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion fa parte di stashy+: sbloccalo in Impostazioni"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion er en del av stashy+ – lås opp i Innstillinger"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motionはstashy+の機能です。設定でロックを解除してください"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion входит в stashy+ — разблокируйте в настройках"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O AI Motion faz parte do stashy+ — desbloqueie em Ajustes"}}}},"hint_ai_motion_uses_real_time":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion använder videoanalys i realtid på enheten för att synkronisera dina enheter. Processen kräver mycket CPU och kan leda till ökad batteriförbrukning och att enheten blir varm. Genom att aktivera funktionen bekräftar du att du använder AI Motion och all styrd hårdvara på egen risk. Eventuella skador på egendom eller person till följd av användning av ansluten hårdvara är helt ditt eget ansvar."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motionは、デバイス上でのリアルタイム動画解析を使用してデバイスを同期します。この処理はCPU負荷が高く、バッテリー消費の増加やデバイスの発熱につながる場合があります。この機能を有効にすることで、AI Motionおよび制御されるハードウェアデバイスを自己責任で使用することに同意したものとみなされます。接続されたハードウェアの使用によって生じる損害や怪我については、すべてご自身の責任となります。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion uses real-time on-device video analysis to synchronize your devices. This process is CPU-intensive and can lead to increased battery drain and device heating. By enabling this feature, you acknowledge that you use AI Motion and any controlled hardware devices at your own risk. Any potential damage or injury resulting from the use of connected hardware is your sole responsibility."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion analyse la vidéo en temps réel sur l'appareil pour synchroniser vos appareils. Ce processus sollicite fortement le processeur et peut augmenter la consommation de batterie et l'échauffement de l'appareil. En activant cette fonction, vous reconnaissez utiliser AI Motion et tout appareil contrôlé à vos propres risques. Tout dommage ou blessure pouvant résulter de l'utilisation du matériel connecté relève de votre seule responsabilité."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion gebruikt realtime videoanalyse op het apparaat om je apparaten te synchroniseren. Dit proces belast de CPU zwaar en kan leiden tot hoger batterijverbruik en opwarming van het apparaat. Door deze functie in te schakelen, erken je dat je AI Motion en alle aangestuurde hardware op eigen risico gebruikt. Eventuele schade of letsel door het gebruik van verbonden hardware is uitsluitend je eigen verantwoordelijkheid."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion bruger videoanalyse i realtid på enheden til at synkronisere dine enheder. Processen er CPU-krævende og kan øge batteriforbruget og få enheden til at blive varm. Ved at slå denne funktion til accepterer du, at du bruger AI Motion og alle styrede hardwareenheder på egen risiko. Enhver skade eller personskade som følge af brugen af tilsluttet hardware er alene dit ansvar."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion bruker videoanalyse i sanntid på enheten for å synkronisere enhetene dine. Prosessen krever mye CPU og kan føre til økt batteriforbruk og at enheten blir varm. Ved å slå på denne funksjonen bekrefter du at du bruker AI Motion og all styrt maskinvare på eget ansvar. Eventuell skade som følge av bruk av tilkoblet maskinvare er ditt eget ansvar."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion usa l'analisi video in tempo reale sul dispositivo per sincronizzare i tuoi dispositivi. Il processo richiede molta CPU e può aumentare il consumo della batteria e il riscaldamento del dispositivo. Attivando questa funzione, riconosci di usare AI Motion e qualsiasi dispositivo hardware controllato a tuo rischio. Eventuali danni o lesioni derivanti dall'uso dell'hardware connesso sono esclusivamente sotto la tua responsabilità."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O AI Motion usa análise de vídeo em tempo real no dispositivo para sincronizar seus dispositivos. Esse processo exige muito da CPU e pode aumentar o consumo de bateria e o aquecimento do dispositivo. Ao ativar este recurso, você reconhece que usa o AI Motion e quaisquer dispositivos de hardware controlados por sua conta e risco. Qualquer dano ou lesão decorrente do uso de hardware conectado é de sua exclusiva responsabilidade."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion은 기기 내 실시간 비디오 분석을 사용하여 기기를 동기화합니다. 이 과정은 CPU를 많이 사용하므로 배터리 소모가 늘고 기기가 뜨거워질 수 있습니다. 이 기능을 활성화하면 AI Motion 및 제어되는 모든 하드웨어 기기를 사용자 본인의 책임하에 사용하는 것에 동의하는 것입니다. 연결된 하드웨어 사용으로 인해 발생할 수 있는 모든 손상이나 부상은 전적으로 사용자의 책임입니다."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion nutzt Echtzeit-Videoanalyse auf dem Gerät, um deine Geräte zu synchronisieren. Das beansprucht die CPU stark und kann zu höherem Akkuverbrauch und Erwärmung des Geräts führen. Mit dem Aktivieren dieser Funktion bestätigst du, dass du AI Motion und alle gesteuerten Hardwaregeräte auf eigenes Risiko verwendest. Für mögliche Schäden oder Verletzungen durch die Nutzung verbundener Hardware bist allein du verantwortlich."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion analizuje wideo w czasie rzeczywistym na urządzeniu, aby synchronizować Twoje urządzenia. Proces ten mocno obciąża procesor i może zwiększyć zużycie baterii oraz nagrzewanie urządzenia. Włączając tę funkcję, potwierdzasz, że korzystasz z AI Motion i wszelkich sterowanych urządzeń sprzętowych na własne ryzyko. Wyłączną odpowiedzialność za ewentualne szkody lub obrażenia wynikające z używania podłączonego sprzętu ponosisz Ty."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion analiza el video en tiempo real en el dispositivo para sincronizar tus dispositivos. Este proceso usa mucho la CPU y puede aumentar el consumo de batería y calentar el dispositivo. Al activar esta función, aceptas que usas AI Motion y cualquier dispositivo de hardware controlado bajo tu propia responsabilidad. Cualquier daño o lesión derivado del uso del hardware conectado es exclusivamente responsabilidad tuya."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion анализирует видео на устройстве в реальном времени, чтобы синхронизировать ваши устройства. Этот процесс сильно нагружает процессор и может ускорить разряд аккумулятора и нагрев устройства. Включая эту функцию, вы подтверждаете, что используете AI Motion и любые управляемые устройства на свой риск. Вы несете единоличную ответственность за любой ущерб или травмы, возникшие при использовании подключенного оборудования."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion 使用设备上的实时视频分析来同步你的设备。此过程会占用大量 CPU，可能导致耗电增加和设备发热。启用此功能即表示你确认使用 AI Motion 及任何受控硬件设备的风险由你自行承担。因使用已连接硬件而导致的任何潜在损坏或伤害均由你本人负责。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion, aygıtlarını eşzamanlamak için aygıt üzerinde gerçek zamanlı video analizi kullanır. Bu işlem işlemciyi yoğun kullanır ve pil tüketiminin artmasına ve aygıtın ısınmasına yol açabilir. Bu özelliği açarak AI Motion'ı ve denetlenen tüm donanım aygıtlarını kendi sorumluluğunda kullandığını kabul edersin. Bağlı donanımın kullanımından doğabilecek her türlü hasar veya yaralanmanın sorumluluğu yalnızca sana aittir."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion 會在裝置上即時分析影片，以同步你的裝置。此過程會大量使用 CPU，可能導致耗電增加和裝置發熱。啟用此功能即表示你了解使用 AI Motion 及任何受控硬體裝置的風險需自行承擔。因使用已連接硬體而可能造成的任何損壞或傷害，均由你自行負責。"}}}},"hint_ai_subtitles_are_part_of":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertexter ingår i stashy+"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕属于 stashy+"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕是 stashy+ 的一部分"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI altyazılar stashy+'nın parçasıdır"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 자막은 stashy+의 일부입니다"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"I sottotitoli IA fanno parte di stashy+"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del af stashy+"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Napisy AI są częścią stashy+"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-ondertiteling maakt deel uit van stashy+"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ИИ-субтитры входят в stashy+"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del av stashy+"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI subtitles are part of stashy+"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"KI-Untertitel sind Teil von stashy+"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Los subtítulos con IA forman parte de stashy+"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sous-titres IA font partie de stashy+"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendas por IA fazem parte do stashy+"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI字幕はstashy+の機能です"}}}},"hint_ai_subtitles_are_part_of_stashy":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-ondertiteling maakt deel uit van stashy+ – ontgrendel in Instellingen"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ИИ-субтитры входят в stashy+ — разблокируйте в настройках"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI subtitles are part of stashy+ — unlock in Settings"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del av stashy+ – lås opp i Innstillinger"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del af stashy+ – lås op i Indstillinger"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Napisy AI są częścią stashy+ — odblokuj w Ustawieniach"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Los subtítulos con IA forman parte de stashy+; desbloquéalo en Ajustes"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI字幕はstashy+の機能です。設定でロックを解除してください"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 자막은 stashy+의 일부입니다 — 설정에서 잠금 해제하세요"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sous-titres IA font partie de stashy+ — débloquez-les dans les réglages"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendas por IA fazem parte do stashy+ — desbloqueie em Ajustes"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"I sottotitoli IA fanno parte di stashy+: sbloccali in Impostazioni"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"KI-Untertitel sind Teil von stashy+ – in den Einstellungen freischalten"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI altyazılar stashy+'nın parçasıdır — Ayarlar'da kilidini aç"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕是 stashy+ 的一部分 — 請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕属于 stashy+ — 请在设置中解锁"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertexter ingår i stashy+ – lås upp i Inställningar"}}}},"hint_all_arg_recorded_o_entries":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全部 %@ 条已记录的 O 及其日期将从服务器上永久删除。此操作无法撤销。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全部 %@ 筆已記錄的 O 項目及其日期將從伺服器永久刪除。此動作無法還原。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kayıtlı %@ O girişinin tümü ve tarihleri sunucudan kalıcı olarak silinir. Bu işlem geri alınamaz."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les %@ entrées O enregistrées et leurs dates seront définitivement supprimées du serveur. Cette action est irréversible."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All %@ recorded O entries and their dates are permanently deleted on the server. This cannot be undone."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ registrerte O-oppføringer og datoene deres slettes permanent på serveren. Dette kan ikke angres."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ erfassten O-Einträge und ihre Daten werden auf dem Server endgültig gelöscht. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ geregistreerde O-items en hun datums worden definitief verwijderd op de server. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla %@ registrerade O-poster och deras datum raderas permanent på servern. Det går inte att ångra."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"기록된 O 항목 %@개와 해당 날짜가 서버에서 영구적으로 삭제됩니다. 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"記録された%@件のOとその日付がすべてサーバーから完全に削除されます。この操作は取り消せません。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ registrerede O-poster og deres datoer slettes permanent på serveren. Det kan ikke fortrydes."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie zapisane wpisy O (%@) wraz z datami zostaną trwale usunięte z serwera. Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Se eliminarán definitivamente del servidor las %@ entradas de O registradas y sus fechas. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Все записанные O (%@) и их даты будут безвозвратно удалены на сервере. Это действие нельзя отменить."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tutte le %@ O registrate e le loro date vengono eliminate definitivamente dal server. Questa azione non può essere annullata."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todos os %@ registros de O e suas datas serão apagados permanentemente no servidor. Não é possível desfazer."}}}},"hint_all_conditions_below_must_be":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla villkor nedan måste vara uppfyllda."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle betingelsene nedenfor må være oppfylt."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les conditions ci-dessous doivent être remplies."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"아래의 모든 조건을 충족해야 합니다."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Bedingungen unten müssen zutreffen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"以下のすべての条件を満たす必要があります。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aan alle voorwaarden hieronder moet worden voldaan."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deben cumplirse todas las condiciones de abajo."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tutte le condizioni qui sotto devono essere vere."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as condições abaixo devem ser verdadeiras."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Должны выполняться все условия ниже."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie poniższe warunki muszą być spełnione."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle betingelser nedenfor skal være opfyldt."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All conditions below must be true."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aşağıdaki tüm koşullar sağlanmalı."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"必须满足下方所有条件。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"須符合下方所有條件。"}}}},"hint_all_home_rows_are_turned":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有首頁列都已關閉"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tüm Ana Sayfa satırları kapalı"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有主页行均已关闭"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla rader på Hem är avstängda"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Zeilen auf Start sind ausgeschaltet"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Все ряды главной выключены"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie wiersze ekranu Start są wyłączone"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tutte le righe della Home sono disattivate"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle radene på Hjem er slått av"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as linhas do Início estão desativadas"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas las filas de Inicio están desactivadas"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームのすべての行がオフになっています"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Home-rijen zijn uitgeschakeld"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle rækker på Hjem er slået fra"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"모든 홈 행이 꺼져 있습니다"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All Home rows are turned off"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les rangées de l'accueil sont désactivées"}}}},"hint_all_images_already_have_rating":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"すべての画像に評価があります。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"У всех изображений уже есть рейтинг."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie obrazy mają już ocenę."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tutte le immagini hanno già una valutazione."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"모든 이미지에 이미 별점이 있습니다."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Bilder haben bereits eine Bewertung."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle billeder har allerede en bedømmelse."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle bilder har allerede en vurdering."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All images already have a rating."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as imagens já têm avaliação."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les images ont déjà une note."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle afbeeldingen hebben al een beoordeling."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas las imágenes ya tienen valoración."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tüm resimlerin zaten puanı var."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla bilder har redan ett betyg."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有图片都已评分。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有圖片都已評分。"}}}},"hint_allow_stashy_to_install_apps":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nstashy'nin uygulama yüklemesine bir kez izin ver, sonra Yükle'ye yeniden dokun."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\n請允許 stashy 安裝 App 一次，然後再點一下「安裝」。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nTillåt stashy att installera appar en gång och tryck sedan på Installera igen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\n请允许 stashy 安装 App 一次，然后再次轻点“安装”。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nPermite una vez que stashy instale apps y vuelve a tocar Instalar."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nPermita uma vez que o stashy instale apps e toque em Instalar novamente."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nSta stashy eenmalig toe apps te installeren en tik dan opnieuw op Installeer."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nstashy가 앱을 설치하도록 한 번 허용한 다음 설치를 다시 탭하세요."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nРазрешите stashy один раз устанавливать приложения, затем снова нажмите «Установить»."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nConsenti una volta a stashy di installare app, poi tocca di nuovo Installa."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nZezwól stashy jednorazowo na instalowanie aplikacji, a następnie stuknij ponownie Instaluj."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nTillat stashy å installere apper én gang, og trykk deretter på Installer igjen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nAllow stashy to install apps once, then tap Install again."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nErlaube stashy einmalig, Apps zu installieren, und tippe dann erneut auf Installieren."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nstashyにアプリのインストールを一度許可してから、もう一度「インストール」をタップしてください。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nTillad stashy at installere apps én gang, og tryk derefter på Installer igen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nAutorisez une fois stashy à installer des apps, puis touchez à nouveau Installer."}}}},"hint_all_scenes_already_have_rating":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scènes hebben al een beoordeling."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"すべてのシーンに評価があります。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Szenen haben bereits eine Bewertung."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"모든 영상에 이미 별점이 있습니다."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"У всех сцен уже есть рейтинг."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All scenes already have a rating."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas las escenas ya tienen valoración."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les scènes ont déjà une note."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie sceny mają już ocenę."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scener har allerede en bedømmelse."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scener har allerede en vurdering."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as cenas já têm avaliação."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tutte le scene hanno già una valutazione."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有短片都已评分。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla scener har redan ett betyg."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tüm sahnelerin zaten puanı var."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有短片都已評分。"}}}},"hint_all_scenes_are_removed_from":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tüm sahneler izleme listesinden kaldırılır. Oynatılan sahne oynamaya devam eder."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有短片都會從待看清單移除。正在播放的內容會繼續播放。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla scener tas bort från bevakningslistan. Det som spelas fortsätter spela."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有短片都将从稍后观看中移除。正在播放的内容会继续播放。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"すべてのシーンがウォッチリストから取り除かれます。再生中のものはそのまま再生されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"모든 영상이 시청 목록에서 제거됩니다. 재생 중인 영상은 계속 재생됩니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tutte le scene vengono rimosse da Da guardare. Ciò che è in riproduzione continua."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie sceny zostaną usunięte z listy Do obejrzenia. To, co jest odtwarzane, będzie odtwarzane dalej."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scener fjernes fra Se senere. Det, der afspilles, fortsætter."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All scenes are removed from the watchlist. What plays keeps playing."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scener fjernes fra Se senere. Det som spilles, fortsetter å spilles."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Все сцены будут удалены из «Смотреть позже». Текущее воспроизведение продолжится."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as cenas serão removidas da lista para assistir. O que está sendo reproduzido continua."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les scènes sont retirées de la liste à regarder. La lecture en cours continue."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Szenen werden aus der Merkliste entfernt. Was gerade läuft, läuft weiter."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scènes worden van de kijklijst gehaald. Wat speelt, blijft spelen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Se quitan todas las escenas de la lista para ver. Lo que se está reproduciendo sigue sonando."}}}},"hint_also_from_menu_below_card":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Auch über das ···-Menü unter einer Karte."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Also from the ··· menu below a card."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Også fra ···-menyen under et kort."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Anche dal menu ··· sotto una scheda."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Également via le menu ··· sous une carte."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Também pelo menu ··· abaixo de um cartão."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Även från menyn ··· under ett kort."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Также через меню ··· под карточкой."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ook via het ···-menu onder een kaart."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"También desde el menú ··· debajo de una tarjeta."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"カードの下の···メニューからも設定できます。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Også fra menuen ··· under et kort."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Również z menu ··· pod kartą."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"카드 아래의 ··· 메뉴에서도 설정할 수 있습니다."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bir kartın altındaki ··· menüsünden de yapılabilir."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"也可通过卡片下方的 ··· 菜单设置。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"也可以從卡片下方的 ··· 選單操作。"}}}},"hint_analyzes_playing_video_live_on":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyserar videon som spelas direkt på enheten och rör din anslutna hårdvara i takt med den. Använder mycket CPU och batteri."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oynatılan videoyu aygıtında canlı olarak analiz eder ve bağlı donanımını onunla eşzamanlı hareket ettirir. Çok fazla işlemci ve pil kullanır."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在设备上实时分析正在播放的视频，并让已连接的硬件与之同步运动。会消耗大量 CPU 和电量。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在你的裝置上即時分析正在播放的影片，並讓已連接的硬體同步動作。會大量使用 CPU 和電池。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyse en direct la vidéo en cours sur votre appareil et fait bouger votre matériel connecté en synchronisation. Consomme beaucoup de processeur et de batterie."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analisa o vídeo em reprodução ao vivo no seu dispositivo e move o hardware conectado em sincronia. Consome muita CPU e bateria."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"재생 중인 비디오를 기기에서 실시간으로 분석하고 연결된 하드웨어를 비디오에 맞춰 움직입니다. CPU와 배터리를 많이 사용합니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analiza en directo en tu dispositivo el video que se reproduce y mueve tu hardware conectado en sincronía. Consume mucha CPU y batería."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analizuje odtwarzane wideo na żywo na urządzeniu i porusza podłączonym sprzętem synchronicznie z nim. Mocno obciąża procesor i baterię."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyserer videoen som spilles direkte på enheten, og beveger den tilkoblede maskinvaren i takt med den. Bruker mye CPU og batteri."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生中の動画をデバイス上でリアルタイムに解析し、接続されたハードウェアを同期して動かします。CPUとバッテリーを多く消費します。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyseert de spelende video live op je apparaat en beweegt je verbonden hardware synchroon mee. Gebruikt veel CPU en batterij."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyserer den afspillede video live på din enhed og bevæger din tilsluttede hardware i takt med den. Bruger meget CPU og batteri."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyzes the playing video live on your device and moves your connected hardware in sync with it. Uses a lot of CPU and battery."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Анализирует воспроизводимое видео в реальном времени на устройстве и синхронно двигает подключенное оборудование. Сильно расходует ресурсы процессора и аккумулятор."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analysiert das laufende Video live auf deinem Gerät und bewegt deine verbundene Hardware synchron dazu. Braucht viel CPU und Akku."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analizza in tempo reale sul dispositivo il video in riproduzione e muove l'hardware connesso in sincronia. Usa molta CPU e batteria."}}}},"hint_api_key_configured":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• konfiguriert"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configurée"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• konfigureret"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• настроен"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configurata"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• 설정됨"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• ingesteld"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configured"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configurada"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• 設定済み"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• skonfigurowano"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• konfigurert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configurada"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• konfigurerad"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• 已配置"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• 已設定"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• yapılandırıldı"}}}},"hint_api_key_is_invalid_or":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API anahtarı geçersiz veya süresi dolmuş"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API 密钥无效或已过期"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AP