ia WebSockets. Verifique se 'Enable Remote Network Access' está ativado nos ajustes do Intiface."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy kobler til Intiface Desktop eller Intiface Central via WebSockets. Sørg for at «Enable Remote Network Access» er slått på i Intiface-innstillingene."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy maakt via WebSockets verbinding met Intiface Desktop of Intiface Central. Zorg dat 'Enable Remote Network Access' is ingeschakeld in de instellingen van Intiface."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy는 WebSocket을 통해 Intiface Desktop 또는 Intiface Central에 연결합니다. Intiface 설정에서 'Enable Remote Network Access'가 켜져 있는지 확인하세요."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyはWebSocketでIntiface DesktopまたはIntiface Centralに接続します。Intifaceの設定で「Enable Remote Network Access」がオンになっていることを確認してください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy verbindet sich per WebSockets mit Intiface Desktop oder Intiface Central. Stelle sicher, dass „Enable Remote Network Access“ in den Intiface-Einstellungen aktiv ist."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy ansluter till Intiface Desktop eller Intiface Central via WebSockets. Se till att ”Enable Remote Network Access” är på i Intifaces inställningar."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy łączy się z Intiface Desktop lub Intiface Central przez WebSockets. Upewnij się, że w ustawieniach Intiface włączono „Enable Remote Network Access”."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy forbinder til Intiface Desktop eller Intiface Central via WebSockets. Sørg for, at 'Enable Remote Network Access' er slået til i Intiface-indstillingerne."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy se connecte à Intiface Desktop ou Intiface Central via WebSockets. Vérifiez que « Enable Remote Network Access » est activé dans les réglages d'Intiface."}}}},"hint_stashy_now_automatically_uploads_local":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy uploader nu automatisk lokale funscripts til Handy Cloud. Den offentlige URL er kun nødvendig ved avancerede opsætninger."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy now automatically uploads local funscripts to Handy Cloud. The Public URL is only needed for advanced setups."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy lädt lokale Funscripts jetzt automatisch in die Handy Cloud hoch. Die öffentliche URL ist nur für fortgeschrittene Setups nötig."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy automatycznie wysyła lokalne funscripty do Handy Cloud. Publiczny URL jest potrzebny tylko w zaawansowanych konfiguracjach."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy теперь автоматически выгружает локальные funscript в Handy Cloud. Public URL нужен только для расширенных конфигураций."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy laster nå automatisk opp lokale funscripts til Handy Cloud. Den offentlige URL-en trengs bare for avanserte oppsett."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이제 Stashy가 로컬 funscript를 Handy Cloud에 자동으로 업로드합니다. 공개 URL은 고급 설정에만 필요합니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy ora carica automaticamente i funscript locali su Handy Cloud. L'URL pubblico serve solo per configurazioni avanzate."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy agora envia automaticamente funscripts locais para a Handy Cloud. A URL pública só é necessária em configurações avançadas."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy uploadt lokale funscripts nu automatisch naar Handy Cloud. De openbare URL is alleen nodig voor geavanceerde configuraties."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy envoie désormais automatiquement les funscripts locaux vers Handy Cloud. L'URL publique n'est nécessaire que pour les configurations avancées."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy ahora sube automáticamente los funscripts locales a Handy Cloud. La URL pública solo es necesaria en configuraciones avanzadas."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyはローカルのfunscriptをHandy Cloudに自動でアップロードするようになりました。公開URLは高度な設定でのみ必要です。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy artık yerel funscript'leri otomatik olarak Handy Cloud'a yükler. Genel URL yalnızca gelişmiş kurulumlar için gerekir."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy laddar nu automatiskt upp lokala funscripts till Handy Cloud. Den publika URL:en behövs bara för avancerade upplägg."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy 現在會自動將本機 funscript 上傳至 Handy Cloud。只有進階設定才需要 Public URL。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy 现在会自动将本地 funscript 上传到 Handy Cloud。只有高级配置才需要公开 URL。"}}}},"hint_stashy_plus_unlocks_premium_features":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ låser upp premiumfunktioner i stashy för iPhone och Apple TV med ett enda köp."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+, tek bir satın almayla iPhone ve Apple TV için stashy'de premium özelliklerin kilidini açar."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"一次购买，stashy+ 即可解锁 iPhone 和 Apple TV 版 stashy 中的高级功能。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ 只需購買一次，即可在 iPhone 和 Apple TV 版 stashy 中解鎖進階功能。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ débloque les fonctions premium de stashy pour iPhone et Apple TV en un seul achat."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+は1回の購入で、iPhoneとApple TVのstashyのプレミアム機能をロック解除します。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ открывает премиум-функции stashy для iPhone и Apple TV одной покупкой."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ unlocks premium features across stashy for iPhone and Apple TV with one purchase."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ schaltet mit einem Kauf Premium-Funktionen in stashy für iPhone und Apple TV frei."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ desbloquea funciones premium en stashy para iPhone y Apple TV con una sola compra."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ odblokowuje funkcje premium w stashy na iPhone'a i Apple TV jednym zakupem."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ sblocca le funzioni premium di stashy per iPhone e Apple TV con un solo acquisto."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+는 한 번의 구입으로 iPhone 및 Apple TV용 stashy 전체에서 프리미엄 기능을 잠금 해제합니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ låser opp premiumfunksjoner i stashy for iPhone og Apple TV med ett kjøp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ ontgrendelt premiumfuncties in stashy voor iPhone en Apple TV met één aankoop."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ låser premiumfunktioner op i stashy til iPhone og Apple TV med ét køb."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy+ desbloqueia recursos premium no stashy para iPhone e Apple TV com uma única compra."}}}},"hint_stashy_plus_unlocks_premium_features_across":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ schaltet mit einem Kauf Premium-Funktionen in stashy für Smartphone, Tablet und Android TV frei."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy+ desbloqueia recursos premium no stashy para celular, tablet e Android TV com uma única compra."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ låser opp premiumfunksjoner i stashy for telefon, nettbrett og Android TV med ett kjøp."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ låser premiumfunktioner op i stashy til telefon, tablet o